HB0062 Prostitution amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Heiner, Larson, JT, Lawley and
Washut and Senator(s) Brennan, Schuler and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to crimes and offenses; amending the crimes of prostitution and
solicitation of prostitution to include acts of sexual contact; providing
definitions; requiring reports; and providing for an effective date.
